# Visual Studio
# ============================================
.vs/
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.filters
*.vcxproj.user
*.sln
CMakeSettings.json

# ============================================
# CMake generated files
# ============================================
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
